# Accepted findings for the Cerbos PDP image only (trivy.yaml passes this file
# with --ignorefile when it scans boilerplate:cerbos, so the api and worker
# images are still held to every finding).
#
# Cerbos 0.57.0, the latest release (2026-10-23), ships a cerbos binary built
# with Go 1.27.3 and golang.org/x/net 0.61.0, which clears every stdlib and
# x/net entry this file held for 0.56.0. It still depends on
# github.com/go-jose/go-jose/v4 4.1.5. The deploy compose keeps the PDP on an
# internal network with no published ports, so only the api and worker can
# reach it.
#
# Each entry expires: when it does, CI fails again. Bump the Cerbos version in
# cerbos/Dockerfile and deploy/docker-compose.developer.yaml if a fixed
# release is out (check its go-jose version with `go version -m` on the
# binary), or renew the date with a reason.

# github.com/go-jose/go-jose/v4: DoS parsing JWKs with RSA keys (fixed in 4.1.6)
CVE-2026-116587 exp:2026-12-15
